,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":95.589440277,"data":"    The obs-write fraction is the number to compare against a claim like\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":95.590108897,"data":"    \"close to the write-bandwidth floor\". It is near 100% only if the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":95.591002892,"data":"    render kernel is bandwidth bound; if it is far below 100% while the\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":95.591913077,"data":"    obs+voxel fraction is also far below, the kernel is bound by neither\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":95.59289628,"data":"    and is DDA-latency or issue bound, which is a different claim entirely.\n"}
